{"title":"AoPS Wiki:Table of Contents","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border:1px solid #999; background: #fff; margin: .3em .3em .3em 1em; padding: 3px; float:right\"><tbody><tr><td>\n<span id=\"shortcut\"><b>Shortcut</b>:<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:TOC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:TOC\">A:TOC</a></div>\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This page hopefully serves as a starting point to become familiar with <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"AoPS Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</a>. Listed below are a few major categories of articles with the links to the articles below them, covering the topics of the AoPS Wiki. The topics below do not begin to cover the enormous amount of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:AllPages\" title=\"Special:AllPages\">content in the AoPS Wiki</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Academics (page does not exist)\">Academics</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_resources\" title=\"Academic resources\">Academic resources</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Academic_resources\" title=\"Category:Academic resources\">category</a>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_competitions\" title=\"Academic competitions\">Academic competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_summer_programs\" title=\"Academic summer programs\">Academic summer programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=College_resources\" title=\"College resources\">College resources</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology\" title=\"Biology\">Biology</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Biology&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Biology (page does not exist)\">category</a>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_resources&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Biology resources (page does not exist)\">Biology resources</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_books\" title=\"Biology books\">Biology books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions\" title=\"Biology competitions\">Biology competitions</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry\" title=\"Chemistry\">Chemistry</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Chemistry&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Chemistry (page does not exist)\">category</a>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_resources&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Chemistry resources (page does not exist)\">Chemistry resources</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_books\" title=\"Chemistry books\">Chemistry books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions\" title=\"Chemistry competitions\">Chemistry competitions</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science\" title=\"Computer science\">Computer science</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Computer_Science&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Computer Science (page does not exist)\">category</a>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Informatics_competitions\" title=\"Informatics competitions\">Informatics competitions</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Economics\" title=\"Economics\">Economics</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Economics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Economics (page does not exist)\">category</a>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Economics_resources&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Economics resources (page does not exist)\">Economics resources</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Economics_books\" title=\"Economics books\">Economics books</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics\" title=\"Mathematics\">Mathematics</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Mathematics\" title=\"Category:Mathematics\">category</a>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_resources\" title=\"Mathematics resources\">Mathematics resources</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_books\" title=\"Mathematics books\">Mathematics books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS Competitions\">AoPS Competitions</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_Olympiads\" title=\"Mathematics Olympiads\">Mathematics Olympiads</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Canadian Mathematical Olympiad\">Canadian Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Cyprus Mathematical Olympiad\">Cyprus Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=United_States_of_America_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"United States of America Mathematical Olympiad\">United States of America Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"International Mathematical Olympiad\">International Mathematical Olympiad</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra\" title=\"Algebra\">Algebra</a> (<a hre